OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people are taking up
OL,4,Abell-ringing to make connections
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany students join sports teams or
OL,7,Facademic societies to make friends at
OL,8,Funiversity. Katie Anderson chose
OL,9,Fbell-ringing instead.
OL,11,FThe 19-year-old says the hobby has
OL,12,Fhelped her build friendships, learn new
OL,13,Fskills and spend less time looking at
OL,14,Fscreens.
OL,16,FKatie says bell-ringing is a "very
OL,17,Fsocial thing to do" and a good way to
OL,18,Fconnect with people away from her
OL,19,Fphone.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
